# k.faces/shards/slots: the slots of the style `plain`: where each part of a face goes (a box in the 0 to 100 frame of the face, x right, y down) and in which order the slots are drawn. A slot with mirror=true holds the side on the viewer's left.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: tools/faces-core.mjs

@k.faces.plain.slot.hair_back k.faces.slot style=plain name=hair_back x=6 y=2 w=88 h=90 z=0 optional=true core.source="hand-core 1"
